{"code":2000,"codename":"Koyuki","data":{"id":513,"skin":"制服","skin_jp":"制服","skin_cn":"","skin_zh_tw":"","skin_list":[{"id":175,"avatar":"//static.kivo.wiki/images/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/avatar.png","skin":"","skin_cn":""},{"id":137,"avatar":"//static.kivo.wiki/images/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/%E5%85%94%E5%A5%B3%E9%83%8E/avatar.png","skin":"兔女郎","skin_cn":"邦妮"},{"id":513,"avatar":"//static.kivo.wiki/images/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/Student_Portrait_CH0282_Collection.png","skin":"制服","skin_cn":""}],"family_name":"角楯","given_name":"花凛","family_name_jp":"角楯","given_name_jp":"カリン","family_name_kr":"카쿠다테","given_name_kr":"카린","family_name_en":"Kakudate","given_name_en":"Karin","family_name_zh_tw":"角楯","given_name_zh_tw":"花凛","family_name_cn":"角楯","given_name_cn":"花凛","nick_name":"JK花凛","momo_talk_signature":"特殊任务执行中","main_relation":35,"relation":[37,34],"age":16,"grade":"二年生","height":170,"birthday":"02-02","hobby":"打扫","designer":"Mx2J","illustrator":"Mx2J","character_voice":"沼仓爱美","character_voice_cn":"喵酱","release_date":"2025-01-20","release_date_cn":null,"release_date_global":"2025-07-08","school":4,"weapon_type":"SR","is_install":true,"is_install_cn":false,"is_install_global":true,"is_npc":false,"show_list":true,"body_shape":"Large","special_appearance":false,"spine":[894,891],"model":[41,353],"voice":[{"description":"ch0282_cafe_monolog_1","category":"cafe","text":"哪里有镜子呢……","text_original":"どこかに鏡は……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0282_cafe_monolog_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0282_cafe_monolog_2","category":"cafe","text":"终于有时间了……老师在哪里呢……","text_original":"時間ができた……先生はどこに……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0282_cafe_monolog_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0282_cafe_monolog_3","category":"cafe","text":"这里有好多可爱的家具啊……我喜欢。","text_original":"ここは可愛い家具が多いな……気に入った。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0282_cafe_monolog_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0282_cafe_monolog_4","category":"cafe","text":"似乎没有敌人的气息。稍微放松一下警戒吧。","text_original":"敵の気配はなさそうだ。警戒を少し緩める。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0282_cafe_monolog_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0282_cafe_monolog_5","category":"cafe","text":"把这边打扫一下…………不行，穿着制服的时候还是算了吧。","text_original":"この辺の掃除を…………いや、制服のときは止めておこう。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0282_cafe_monolog_5.ogg"},{"description":"ch0282_commonskill","category":"battle","text":"目标，确认！","text_original":"ターゲット、確認！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0282_commonskill.ogg"},{"description":"ch0282_eventlobby_1","category":"event","text":"怎、怎么了？有委托吗？","text_original":"ど、どうしたんだ？依頼か？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0282_eventlobby_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0282_eventlobby_2","category":"event","text":"这、这身是千禧指定的制服……？有什么奇怪的地方吗？","text_original":"こ、これはミレニアム指定の制服だけど……？何か変なところでもあるのか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0282_eventlobby_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0282_eventlobby_3","category":"event","text":"那个……老师。难得穿上制服，所以那个，要不要和我一起……","text_original":"えっと……先生。せっかくの制服だ、からその、私と一緒に……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0282_eventlobby_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0282_eventlobby_4","category":"event","text":"……还、还是算了，没什么。请不要在意。","text_original":"……や、やはり、何でもない。気にしないでくれ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0282_eventlobby_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0282_eventlogin_1","category":"event","text":"辛、辛苦了，老师。……还是不太习惯这样说啊。","text_original":"お、お疲れ、先生。……言い慣れないな。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0282_eventlogin_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0282_eventlogin_2","category":"event","text":"打招呼要再可爱一点…………刚、刚才只是我自言自语！","text_original":"もう少し可愛い挨拶を…………い、今のは独り言だ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0282_eventlogin_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0282_eventlogin_season_1","category":"event","text":"真是的…一点都让人放松不下来","text_original":"まったく……気が休まらない。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0282_eventlogin_season_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0282_eventlogin_season_2","category":"event","text":"就差一点了，老师。一起加油吧。","text_original":"あと少しだ、先生。一緒に頑張ろう。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0282_eventlogin_season_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0282_eventlogin_season_end","category":"event","text":"结束了啊。结束后反而……感到有些依依不舍。","text_original":"終わったんだな。終わってみると逆に……名残惜しく感じる。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0282_eventlogin_season_end.ogg"},{"description":"ch0282_exskill_1","category":"battle","text":"那个……呃…………！危险！","text_original":"その……えっと…………！危ない！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0282_exskill_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0282_exskill_2","category":"battle","text":"啊，那个是…………！趴下！","text_original":"ああ、それは…………！伏せろ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0282_exskill_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0282_exskill_3","category":"battle","text":"光靠我有些…………！到这边来！","text_original":"ちょっと私では…………！こっちに！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0282_exskill_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0282_exskill_level_1","category":"battle","text":"危险已排除。已经不要紧了。","text_original":"危険を排除した。もう大丈夫だ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0282_exskill_level_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0282_exskill_level_2","category":"battle","text":"没问题。我来解决。","text_original":"問題ない。私が解決する。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0282_exskill_level_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0282_exskill_level_3","category":"battle","text":"开始支援。后面就交给我吧。","text_original":"援護開始。あとは任せてくれ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0282_exskill_level_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0282_exweapon_get","category":"growup","text":"我发誓，无论何时，无论以何种姿态，都会为了老师您而赶来。","text_original":"いつでも、どんな姿でも、先生のために駆けつけると誓おう。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0282_exweapon_get.ogg"},{"description":"ch0282_gachaget","category":"growup","text":"千禧科学学院的角楯花凛，准备就绪。……这、这身衣服，看起来还行吧？","text_original":"ミレニアムサイエンススクールの角楯カリン、準備はできてる。……こ、この服装、大丈夫そうか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0282_gachaget.ogg"},{"description":"ch0282_growup_1","category":"growup","text":"老师，这份恩情……我绝对不会忘记。","text_original":"先生、この恩は……絶対に忘れない。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0282_growup_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0282_growup_2","category":"growup","text":"虽然不是平时的穿着…但也有这身装扮才能完成的任务。","text_original":"いつもの格好ではないが……この姿でしかできない仕事も、あるから。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0282_growup_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0282_growup_3","category":"growup","text":"为我，做到这个地步……谢谢您。我会用这份力量，保护好老师的。","text_original":"私に、ここまで……ありがとう。この力で、先生を守ってみせる。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0282_growup_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0282_growup_4","category":"growup","text":"老师……我明白了。为了不辜负您的期待, 我会做到最好","text_original":"先生……分かった。期待に応えられるよう、善処する。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0282_growup_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0282_lobby_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"嗯？啊，今天穿着制服。……理由吗？","text_original":"うん？ああ、今日は制服を着ている。……理由？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0282_lobby_1_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0282_lobby_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"呵呵……是为什么呢。就请您猜猜看吧。","text_original":"ふふ……なんだろうな。当ててみてくれ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0282_lobby_1_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0282_lobby_2","category":"lobby","text":"或许是因为穿着和平时不同的服装，总觉得直觉变敏锐了一些。","text_original":"いつもと違う服装だからか、少し勘が鋭くなっているようだ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0282_lobby_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0282_lobby_3_1","category":"lobby","text":"我平时很少有机会穿制服……应该没有哪里怪怪的吧？","text_original":"制服を着る機会があまりなくて……変なところはないだろうか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0282_lobby_3_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0282_lobby_3_2","category":"lobby","text":"话虽如此……老、老师您也不要一直盯着看！","text_original":"そうは言ったが……み、見すぎだ先生！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0282_lobby_3_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0282_lobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"不会妨碍任务执行的。希望您和之前一样，不用客气直接说。","text_original":"任務遂行に支障はない。これまで通り、遠慮なく言ってほしい。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0282_lobby_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0282_lobby_5_1","category":"lobby","text":"早上好，老师。今天一天也请您多多指教。","text_original":"おはようございます、先生。今日も一日、よろしくお願いします。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0282_lobby_5_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0282_lobby_5_2","category":"lobby","text":"我想试着像普通学生一样向您打招呼……会、会很奇怪吗？","text_original":"生徒として挨拶をしてみたのだけど……へ、変だっただろうか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0282_lobby_5_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0282_login_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"啊，老师。我在等您。","text_original":"ああ、先生。待ってた。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0282_login_1_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0282_login_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"……您问为什么要等？护卫工作需要理由吗？","text_original":"……なんでって？護衛に理由が必要だろうか。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0282_login_1_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0282_login_2","category":"lobby","text":"欢迎回来，老师。还有，您辛苦了。","text_original":"おかえり、先生。それから、お疲れ様。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0282_login_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0282_memoriallobby_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"……啊！老师！等、等一下！","text_original":"……あっ！先生！ま、待ってくれ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0282_memoriallobby_1_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0282_memoriallobby_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"就这样直接给您，有点……！","text_original":"このまま渡すのは、ちょっと……！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0282_memoriallobby_1_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0282_memoriallobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"因为，这是用我的脚夹过的，所以……","text_original":"その、私が脚で挟んでしまったもの、だから……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0282_memoriallobby_2_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0282_memoriallobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"这个让我吃，老师请吃这边的……！","text_original":"これは私が食べるから、先生はこっちを……！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0282_memoriallobby_2_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0282_memoriallobby_3_1","category":"lobby","text":"……啊。","text_original":"……あ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0282_memoriallobby_3_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0282_memoriallobby_3_2","category":"lobby","text":"这是我吃过的……","text_original":"これは私の食べかけ……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0282_memoriallobby_3_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0282_memoriallobby_4_1","category":"lobby","text":"不、不是的！我不是那个意思……！","text_original":"ち、違う！そういう意味じゃなくて……！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0282_memoriallobby_4_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0282_memoriallobby_4_2","category":"lobby","text":"那果然还是这边的…………！也、不对！","text_original":"やっぱこっちの…………！では、なくて！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0282_memoriallobby_4_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0282_memoriallobby_5_1","category":"lobby","text":"我真的，没有那种打算……！","text_original":"本当に、そんなつもりは……！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0282_memoriallobby_5_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0282_memoriallobby_5_2","category":"lobby","text":"无、无论哪一个……呜呜……","text_original":"ど、どちらを渡しても……うう……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0282_memoriallobby_5_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0282_memoriallobby_5_3","category":"lobby","text":"我、我该怎么办才好……！","text_original":"わ、私はどうすれば……！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0282_memoriallobby_5_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0282_relationship_up_1","category":"growup","text":"老师觉得这身打扮……怎么样？","text_original":"先生はこの格好……どう思う？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0282_relationship_up_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0282_relationship_up_2","category":"growup","text":"今天由我来负责老师的贴身护卫工作。这身衣服的话……应该也不会被怀疑吧。","text_original":"今日は先生の身辺警護を行う。この服装なら……怪しまれることもないだろう。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0282_relationship_up_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0282_relationship_up_3","category":"growup","text":"穿着制服站在老师身边……总觉得很新鲜，真好。","text_original":"制服姿で先生の隣に立つのは……なんだか新鮮で、良いな。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0282_relationship_up_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0282_relationship_up_4","category":"growup","text":"虽然是在执行任务……但要和老师说话的话, 我会腾出时间的。随时来找我吧。","text_original":"任務中ではあるが……先生と話す時間は作れる。いつでも声をかけてくれ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0282_relationship_up_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0282_season_birthday","category":"lobby","text":"生日……谢谢您。今天一整天都能和老师在一起吗……好开心。","text_original":"誕生日……ありがとう。今日は一日中、先生と一緒にいられるのか……嬉しい。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0282_season_birthday.ogg"},{"description":"ch0282_season_birthday_player","category":"lobby","text":"祝您生日快乐。想要什么就请告诉我。我想送一些能让老师高兴的东西。","text_original":"お誕生日おめでとう。欲しいものがあれば言ってくれ。先生が喜ぶものを、贈りたいんだ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0282_season_birthday_player.ogg"},{"description":"ch0282_season_halloween","category":"lobby","text":"是万圣节啊。因为平时不怎么穿制服，总觉得已经像是在变装了。","text_original":"ハロウィーンか。普段あまり制服を着ないからなんだかもう仮装をしているような気分だ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0282_season_halloween.ogg"},{"description":"ch0282_season_newyear_1","category":"lobby","text":"老师，祝您新年快乐。今年也请多些和我这样……","text_original":"先生、明けましておめでとう。今年はもう少し、こうして私と……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0282_season_newyear_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0282_season_newyear_2","category":"lobby","text":"没、没什么。","text_original":"な、何でもない。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0282_season_newyear_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0282_season_xmas","category":"lobby","text":"总觉得这身打扮对过圣诞来说有点太普通了……‘只要合适就行’？ 谢谢你。","text_original":"クリスマスを過ごすのに、この服装は平凡すぎる気が……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0282_season_xmas.ogg"},{"description":"CH0282_Title","category":"lobby","text":"蔚蓝档案。","text_original":"ブルー、アーカイブ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/%E6%A0%A1%E6%9C%8D/jp/CH0282_Title.ogg"},{"description":"ch0282_formation_in_2","category":"formation","text":"要穿成这样工作吗……？","text_original":"この格好で仕事をするのか……？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/%E5%88%B6%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0282_formation_in_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0282_formation_in_1","category":"formation","text":"您是在找向导吗？","text_original":"ガイドを探しているのか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/%E5%88%B6%E6%9C%8D/jp/ch0282_formation_in_1.ogg"}],"voice_cn":[],"voice_kr":[{"description":"ch0282_cafe_monolog_1","category":"cafe","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/%E5%88%B6%E6%9C%8D/kr/ch0282_cafe_monolog_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0282_cafe_monolog_2","category":"cafe","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%A7%92%E6%A5%AF%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%87%9B/%E5%88%B6%E6%9C%8D/kr/ch0282_cafe_monolog_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0282_cafe_monolog_3","category":"cafe","text":"","text_original":"",